   &= -\sin (180^{\circ}-60^{\circ}) (-\cos 30^{\circ}) - \cos (360^{\circ}-60^{\circ}) \sin (360^{\circ}-30^{\circ}) \\
   &= \sin 60^{\circ} \cos 30^{\circ} + \cos 60^{\circ} \sin 30^{\circ} \\
